  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a wok over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced shiitake mushrooms and cook until they are tender.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Stir in the lemon juice and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Warm the pandan leaves by wrapping them in a damp paper towel and microwaving for 20 seconds.",
    "Assemble the wrap by spooning the mushroom mixture onto a pandan leaf and topping with a dollop of yogurt.",
    "Fold the pandan leaf over the filling to form a wrap.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
